  "statement": "\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUse your calculator to find a prime number between 710 and 720.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
  "statementFigure": null,
  "question": null,
  "widgetSlot": null,
  "steps": [
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eQuickly eliminate a few possibilities.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eWe can quickly eliminate a few possibilities. Any prime number greater than 2 must be odd; otherwise, it has 2 as a factor and is not prime. Also, 715 is clearly divisible by 5.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eSo we just have to check the numbers 711, 713, 717, and 719.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eYou can use \u003ci\u003eMansimp\u003c/i\u003e mode to do this.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17153\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qmode.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_17153\u0026quot;,186)\"\u003e. In the fourth line, use the arrow keys and \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17154\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_17154\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e to select \u003ci\u003eb/c\u003c/i\u003e. In the fifth line, select \u003ci\u003eMansimp\u003c/i\u003e and press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17155\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_17155\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-3 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_3_1_numbertheory_7_20/f-20-7-1.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17156\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2nd.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17157\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qquit.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_17157\u0026quot;,207)\"\u003e to return to the home screen.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17158\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2nd.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17159\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qquit.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_17159\u0026quot;,207)\"\u003e to return to the home screen.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17160\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q7.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17161\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q1.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17162\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q1.gif\"\u003e\u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17163\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qfrac.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_17163\u0026quot;,154)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17164\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q1.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17165\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q1.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17166\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q1.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17167\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_17167\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe calculator shows the fraction with an arrow next to it.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-5 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_3_1_numbertheory_7_20/f-20-7-2.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe arrow indicates that you can use the \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17168\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qsimp.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_17168\u0026quot;,214)\"\u003e key to simplify the fraction one factor at a time.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe arrow indicates that you can use the \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17169\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qsimp.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_17169\u0026quot;,214)\"\u003e key to simplify the fraction one factor at a time.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17170\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qsimp.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_17170\u0026quot;,214)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17171\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_17171\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e. The calculator factors out a 3 from the numerator and denominator.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eSo, 711 is not prime.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-7 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_3_1_numbertheory_7_20/f-20-7-3.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
